(
    title: "Depth Charge",
    developer: Some("Jerry Lawson (Videosoft)"),
    description: Some("An unreleased periscope shooter: from a submarine\'s crosshair view you lead six kinds of surface ship with fixed or guided torpedoes, across variations that meter your supply at 30, 60 or 90 — and a torpedo boat sinks you if it slips across the screen unchallenged. Planned as head-to-head play with the second player commanding the ships, but only the submarine half was ever built before Amiga turned to computers."),
